{"t":"Fiend Slayer Outfits Quest","s":"fiend-slayer-outfits-quest-8a75c","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fiend_Slayer_Male_Addon_3_d2d1b0.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Fiend Slayer Outfits Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/quest/no-rest-for-the-wicked-quest\">No Rest for the Wicked Quest</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">250<br/>(500+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">14.10.4e0c16<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 25, 2024<br/>Winter Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>A powerful boss named Arbaziloth lurks in the depths of Azzilon, guarding powerful items and unleashing chaos on anyone daring to enter his domain. Only the bravest adventurers will survive the trials of this dangerous quest.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Azzilon\">Azzilon</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Brinebrute%20Inferniarch\">Brinebrute Inferniarch</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gorger%20Inferniarch\">Gorger Inferniarch</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Spellreaper%20Inferniarch\">Spellreaper Inferniarch</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Broodrider%20Inferniarch\">Broodrider Inferniarch</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sineater%20Inferniarch\">Sineater Inferniarch</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellhunter%20Inferniarch\">Hellhunter Inferniarch</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Fiend%20Slayer%20Outfits\">Fiend Slayer Outfits</a> and the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Fiend%20Slayer\">Fiend Slayer</a>. <br/><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Fiend Slayer Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fiend_Slayer_Male_Addon_3_d2d1b0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Fiend Slayer Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fiend_Slayer_Female_Addon_3_400b48.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Base_Outfit\">Base Outfit</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Male Fiend Slayer Base Outfit\"><img alt=\"Male Fiend Slayer Base Outfit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fiend_Slayer_Male_a0af5c.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Female Fiend Slayer Base Outfit\"><img alt=\"Female Fiend Slayer Base Outfit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fiend_Slayer_Female_ee4604.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n</p><p>To obtain the base outfit, you need to complete the <a href=\"#/quest/no-rest-for-the-wicked-quest\">No Rest for the Wicked Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_1\">Addon 1</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Male Fiend Slayer Addon 1\"><img alt=\"Male Fiend Slayer Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fiend_Slayer_Male_Addon_1_a199da.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Female Fiend Slayer Addon 1\"><img alt=\"Female Fiend Slayer Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fiend_Slayer_Female_Addon_1_1aab6f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n</p><p>Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Claws\">Set of Demon Claws</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Claws\"><img alt=\"Demon Claws\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Claws_103bf4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> and you will receive the first addon, these can be looted from <a href=\"#/wiki/Arbaziloth\">Arbaziloth</a>, <b>when killed on easy mode</b>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_2\">Addon 2</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Male Fiend Slayer Addon 2\"><img alt=\"Male Fiend Slayer Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fiend_Slayer_Male_Addon_2_dbcbb1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Female Fiend Slayer Addon 2\"><img alt=\"Female Fiend Slayer Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fiend_Slayer_Female_Addon_2_ef094e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n</p><p>Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skull\">Demon Skull</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skull\"><img alt=\"Demon Skull\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Skull_c1d489.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> and you will receive the second addon, this can be looted from <a href=\"#/wiki/Arbaziloth\">Arbaziloth</a>, <b>when killed on hard mode</b>.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Upon receiving both addons, you'll receive the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Fiend%20Slayer\">Fiend Slayer</a>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["no-rest-for-the-wicked-quest"]}